WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:10.368
In tutorial 11.4, you'll
create an API key,

00:00:10.418 --> 00:00:13.493
a private key that lets
another tool read your data,

00:00:13.543 --> 00:00:17.493
and connect an AI assistant that
answers questions about your rankings,

00:00:17.543 --> 00:00:19.031
traffic and audits.

00:00:20.050 --> 00:00:23.829
First, open Company settings,
and choose API access.

00:00:26.054 --> 00:00:29.829
Name the key after what uses
it. Then choose what it may do,

00:00:29.879 --> 00:00:33.328
from reading your data to
starting analyses or exports.

00:00:34.322 --> 00:00:37.897
If you tick Start analyses,
the key can use your credits,

00:00:37.947 --> 00:00:40.729
and Alaventra warns you
that it can change things.

00:00:41.709 --> 00:00:46.818
For questions only, leave it off. Choose
when the key expires, and click Create key.

00:00:48.738 --> 00:00:53.613
Your new key is shown only this once.
Click Copy key, and keep it somewhere safe,

00:00:53.663 --> 00:00:55.162
like a password manager.

00:00:56.213 --> 00:01:00.063
It's listed under Your keys, with
what it can do, when it was last used,

00:01:00.113 --> 00:01:01.553
and when it expires.

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:06.908
Next, open Integrations,
and find AI assistants.

00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:12.634
There's a ready setup for Claude Code,
Claude Desktop, and OpenAI's developer tools.

00:01:13.602 --> 00:01:15.602
Click Copy beside your assistant,

00:01:15.652 --> 00:01:18.412
and put your key in place
of the short one at the end.

00:01:20.652 --> 00:01:25.114
Not sure how? Show me how walks you
through it, with the exact address to use.

00:01:27.627 --> 00:01:29.777
Then just ask. For example,

00:01:29.827 --> 00:01:33.756
which high-severity findings are
new on my site since the last audit?

00:01:34.676 --> 00:01:38.982
When a key is no longer needed, click
Revoke beside it, under Your keys.

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:45.240
It stops working on its very next
request, and shows as Revoked.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:50.905
Now your AI assistant can answer
questions about your websites,

00:01:50.955 --> 00:01:53.522
and your own scripts can
read the same figures.

00:01:54.562 --> 00:01:58.247
So, create a key and choose
what it may do, copy it once,

00:01:58.297 --> 00:02:01.225
add it to your AI assistant,
and revoke it when you're done.

00:02:02.244 --> 00:02:08.562
Your data is one question away. Next,
protect your account, in tutorial 11.5.
